      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "Я живу в городе уже пять лет, и мне нравится.",
       "alumno": "I have lived in the city for five years and I like it.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "Во-первых, здесь много работы. Во-вторых, есть метро.",
       "alumno": "Firstly, there is a lot of work here. Secondly, there is the metro.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "Однако шум мне надоедает, поэтому я мечтаю о доме за городом.",
       "alumno": "However, the noise wears me out, so I dream of a house outside the city.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "Если получится, через год я перееду.",
       "alumno": "If it works out, in a year I will move.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "В итоге всё зависит от работы.",
       "alumno": "In the end, everything depends on work.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    }
